WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.653
Day 2. Say It, Count It.

2
00:00:02.103 --> 00:00:09.115
Watch first. The first one on the page is written for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.615 --> 00:00:15.148
Today there is almost no writing. Read the first sentence out loud. Your child says it back.

4
00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:19.209
Then your child says it again and puts up one finger for each word.

5
00:00:19.659 --> 00:00:22.010
Your child colors one dot for each word.

6
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:28.066
Job two: your child says a sentence about each picture, and counts its words on their fingers.
